Package: tennisage
Title: Tennis Career Match Age Difference Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Annie", "Devine", , "agdevine17@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Gets match data from Tennis Abstract. Analyses player and opponents ages. Creates scatterplot of career matches vs age difference between player and opponent, color coded by match outcome.
